## Task 3: Production Launch Audit

**Use `claude --chrome` to navigate the deployed production app.**

### 3.1 Homepage Load Test

**Navigate to:** `https://<production-url>.vercel.app`

**Verify:**
- [ ] Page loads without errors
- [ ] No console errors in DevTools
- [ ] CSP headers present (check Network tab → Response Headers)
- [ ] Dark mode + light mode both work

### 3.2 Authentication Flow Test

**Navigate to:** `https://<production-url>.vercel.app/signup`

**Test:**
1. Sign up with a test email (e.g., `test@example.com`)
2. Check for email confirmation (may not work without SMTP — acceptable)
3. If confirmation works → verify → login
4. If confirmation doesn't work → try login directly (may fail, document)

**Acceptable outcomes:**
- ✅ Signup creates user, triggers email (even if undeliverable)
- ✅ Error message is friendly (not raw stack trace)
- ⚠️ SMTP not configured = expected, document

### 3.3 Dashboard Verification

**Navigate to:** `https://<production-url>.vercel.app/dashboard`

**Verify:**
- [ ] Rewards card UI renders
- [ ] 0 points displayed
- [ ] No console errors
- [ ] Animations work (reduced motion respected)

### 3.4 QR Code Display

**Navigate to:** `https://<production-url>.vercel.app/qr`

**Verify:**
- [ ] QR code renders
- [ ] Code is scannable (visual inspection — should be high contrast)
- [ ] Dark mode shows white QR on dark background

### 3.5 Menu Browse

**Navigate to:** `https://<production-url>.vercel.app/menu`

**Verify:**
- [ ] Categories load
- [ ] Items display with images (or placeholder)
- [ ] Sticky nav works
- [ ] No console errors

### 3.6 Console Sweep (Critical)

**Open DevTools console on each page:**
- `/` (homepage)
- `/login`
- `/dashboard`
- `/qr`
- `/menu`
- `/about`

**Verify:**
- [ ] **0 CSP violations** (critical security gate)
- [ ] **0 unhandled errors** (warnings acceptable)
- [ ] Network requests succeed (200/304 status codes)

### 3.7 Lighthouse Audit (If Time Permits)

**Run Lighthouse in Chrome DevTools:**
- Target: `/dashboard` page
- Profile: Mobile, throttled

**Acceptable scores:**
- Performance: ≥ 80 (target ≥ 90, but 80+ is acceptable for launch)
- Accessibility: ≥ 90
- Best Practices: ≥ 90
- SEO: ≥ 90

**If scores are low:** Document findings, but do not block launch unless 
critical (e.g., accessibility < 80)

